OL,3,GNEWSA'Stunning and varied' 120-mile
OL,4,Awalking route opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new 120-mile (193km) walking route
OL,7,Ftaking in high fells, moorland, rivers
OL,8,Fand the coast has officially opened.
OL,10,FThe Westmorland and Furness Way is a
OL,11,Fsigned trail across Cumbria from the
OL,12,Fruins of Furness Abbey to Alston and is
OL,13,Festimated to take between eight and 17
OL,14,Fdays to complete.
OL,16,FWestmorland and Furness Council hopes
OL,17,Fit will boost trade in towns and
OL,18,Fvillages along the route, with
OL,19,Fcouncillor Adrian Waite saying the walk
OL,20,Fwas for "people of all ages, all levels
OL,21,Fand fitness".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
